        <activityName xml:lang="en">Treatment, effluent from NF3 production, to wastewater treatment, class 3</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Treatment, effluent from NF3 production, to wastewater treatment, class 3
Wastewater purified in a medium size municipal wastewater treatment plant (capacity class 3), with an average capacity size of 24900 per-captia-equivalents PCE. \nWastewater contains (in kg/m3): NH4-N: 0.0104 (GSD=122.5%);
UUID: 8148929b-4543-49a5-bff8-65b0b6e1230d
Infrastructure materials for municipal wastewater treatment plant, transports, dismantling. Land use burdens.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Three stage wastewater treatment (mechanical, biological, chemical) including sludge digestion (fermentation) according to the average technology in Switzerland
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8148929b-4543-49a5-bff8-65b0b6e1230d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
